WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.411 --> 00:00:03.761
Unit fifteen. WASH Worldwide!

2
00:00:04.702 --> 00:00:08.986
Hello, everyone! I'm Doctor Sokha, your school doctor.

3
00:00:09.036 --> 00:00:12.188
Hi, Doctor Sokha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:12.238 --> 00:00:15.790
Today we learn about WASH Worldwide. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.670 --> 00:00:20.353
WASH. Say it with me. WASH!

6
00:00:23.824 --> 00:00:27.957
Safe water. Say it with me. Safe water!

7
00:00:31.486 --> 00:00:36.069
Sanitation. Say it with me. Sanitation!

8
00:00:39.514 --> 00:00:43.198
Hygiene. Say it with me. Hygiene!

9
00:00:46.706 --> 00:00:51.439
Diarrhoeal disease. Say it with me. Diarrhoeal disease!

10
00:00:54.943 --> 00:00:59.226
Infrastructure. Say it with me. Infrastructure!

11
00:01:02.744 --> 00:01:06.294
Equity. Say it with me. Equity!

12
00:01:09.790 --> 00:01:14.907
SDG 6. Say it with me. SDG 6!

13
00:01:18.406 --> 00:01:29.668
WASH — safe water, sanitation, and hygiene — prevents diarrhoeal disease. Investment in infrastructure and equity is needed to reach SDG 6.

14
00:01:29.718 --> 00:01:33.650
Now I understand. Thank you, Doctor Sokha!

15
00:01:34.381 --> 00:01:39.619
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:39.669 --> 00:01:40.819
Sanitation!

17
00:01:41.918 --> 00:01:47.227
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:47.277 --> 00:01:48.427
Equity!

19
00:01:49.415 --> 00:01:56.992
Did you know? Sustainable Development Goal 6 aims for clean water and sanitation for all by 2030!

20
00:01:57.042 --> 00:01:59.577
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:02:00.425 --> 00:02:08.990
Think and answer. Why is WASH important for schools?

22
00:02:09.040 --> 00:02:10.306
Great answer!

23
00:02:11.130 --> 00:02:16.354
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:16.404 --> 00:02:19.107
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

